---
description: How to write and publish posts in this Hexo blog
alwaysApply: true
---

Canonical guide: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. The rules that matter:

- Source posts live in `source/_posts/`. `main` is the source branch,
  `gh-pages` is generated and must not be edited.
- Never commit `public/`, `db.json`, or `node_modules/`.
- Never push to `main`. Work on a branch (`post/<slug>`) and open a PR.
- Front matter: `title`, `slug`, `date`, `lang`, `category`, `tags`, `author`,
  `summary`.
- Multi-language posts share one `slug`: `<slug>.md` (en), `<slug>-fr.md` (fr),
  `<slug>-cn.md` (中), plus a `> Languages: ...` line after the front matter.
- Leave a blank line before every Markdown table, or it renders as plain text.
- Do not paste diff markers (`+`) into code blocks.
- Validate: `npm install && node .github/setup-mathjax.js && npm run build`.
